1 NAME Charles Godefroi Sophie Jules Marie /de Rohan/
2 GIVN Charles Godefroi Sophie Jules Marie
2 SURN de Rohan
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 28 JUL 1748
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} On 28 July 1748, Marie Louise gave birth to a son, who was baptised Charles Godefroi Sophie Jules Marie de Rohan. It was her mother-in-law who wrote to Charles's father, 'the Old Pretender', in Rome to tell of the 
2 CONC news, but not that this child was his grandchild. Despite having been accepted as a member of the Rohan family, several genealogical books note the fact that the Rohans fail to mention this child again. Allegedly, Charles Godefroi
2 CONC  died aged around five months, in either December 1748[3] or 18 January 1749.[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT Louise lived at least another thirty-three years and apparently was never unfaithful again. To all appearances she was a good wife and mother to her first-born but never had another child. She made occasional appearances at court,
2 CONC  then later in life became religious and devoted much of her time to charity. 
