1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===LEON JAN PININSKI===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Leon Piniński''' (1857-1938) was a Polish scientist, diplomat, art historian and politician. A professor of Roman law and one-time rector of the Lwów University (1928–1929), he devoted most of his life to political career in hi
2 CONC s hometown of Lwów (modern Lviv, Ukraine), initially in Austria-Hungary and then in Poland. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leon_Pini%C5%84ski Wikipedia EN]
2 CONT
