2 CONT Prince Luigi della Torre e Tasso (Castel Duino 5 October 1908 – Camillus, New York 25 March 1985)[4] was  the son of Prince Alessandro della Torre e Tasso, 1st Duke of Castel Duino (d. 1937) and his first wife, Marie Susanne Margu
2 CONC erite Louise de Ligne.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Frances Goodyear (granddaughter of Buffalo, New York industrialist Charles W. Goodyear in 1939.[5][
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT They divorced in 1948.[6] Together they had one son, “Sascha” Alexander Frederick Bradley, Prince of Torre e Tasso (1940-2011).[7]
2 CONT
